  "scope": "Actual Framework public API metadata for all 140 numbered default read-only codec objects. Native covers ten invariant properties and GetMaxByteCount/GetMaxCharCount. For each codec both count functions are called at every input 0..65535; little-endian Int32 result sequences have independent FNV64 fingerprints. Models are also checked against actual negative, large and Int32 overflow boundary calls. EncodingName en-US/ru-RU columns and the 197 public-declaration inventory are positive requirements, not implemented API coverage. Constructors, EncodingName/current UI culture, default/code-page zero, fallback/offset and whole module/library behavior remain unfinished. No Pascal compiler is invoked.",
